    "description": "Title:\nVintage Aqua Glass Insulators TEL & TEL CO. Set of 2\nBrand:\nTEL & TEL CO.\nDepartment:\nAdults\nStyle:\nVintage industrial\nColor:\nAqua blue\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nType:\nGlass insulator\nCare Instructions:\nHand wash only\nDesign:\nEmbossed lettering\nFeatures:\nEmbossed lettering\nGlassware Type:\nUtility/Industrial\nMaterial:\nGlass\nNumber Of Items In Set:\n2\nPattern:\nSolid\nSet Includes:\n2 insulators\nShape:\nRound\nUnit Quantity:\n2\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nAdd unique vintage appeal to your space with this set of two embossed glass insulators. Perfect for collectors or home decorators, each insulator is made of thick aqua blue glass and features raised lettering for TEL & TEL CO., reflecting their historical use in utility and telegraph applications. Both pieces display visible bubbles, swirl marks, and a charmingly rustic texture that captures their industrial era origins. Use them as eye-catching decorative accents, paperweights, or repurpose them in a creative DIY project. Both insulators are in used vintage condition with minor marks and light wear visible, adding authenticity and character. Their solid weight and striking color make them stand out on a shelf or mantle, ideal for collectors of industrial or railroad memorabilia. Please review the photographs for details and overall appearance.",
